OL,3,GNEWSACommunity groups can bid for cash
OL,4,Afrom warehousing
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharities, voluntary organisations,
OL,7,Fparish councils, sport and community
OL,8,Fgroups have been asked to apply for a
OL,9,Fshare of an #895,000 grant, secured
OL,10,Ffrom one of the UK's largest logistics
OL,11,Fparks.
OL,13,FNorth Northamptonshire Council said the
OL,14,Fcash was coming from the Magna Park
OL,15,FDevelopment Impact Fund. The park is an
OL,16,F80-hectare (198-acre) site on the
OL,17,Foutskirts of Corby.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
