OL,3,GNEWSACommunity groups can bid for cash
OL,4,Afrom warehousing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pot of money was secured from
OL,7,Fdeveloper contributions and will be
OL,8,Fused to "support communities impacted
OL,9,Fby the major development", the council
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FCompanies like Nike and Bleckmann are
OL,13,Fbased on the park and it could see
OL,14,F7,000 people eventually employed there.
